atts Version 5 Manual, NREL/TP-6A20-62641, default system losses (wiring 2 %)"}, {"key": "availability.plant", "value": 0.99, "unit": "fraction", "status": "unverified", "source": "NREL, 'PV System Availability from Commercial and Utility-Scale Systems' (OSTI 2323270): median (P50) system availability 0.99 across 1,128 US systems"}, {"key": "availability.inverter", "value": 1.0, "unit": "fraction", "status": "proxy", "source": "Included in availability.plant: the NREL measure is system-level, so a separate inverter factor would double-count (OSTI 2323270)"}, {"key": "availability.storage", "value": 0.97, "unit": "fraction", "status": "unverified", "source": "Energy-Storage.News on LTSAs and BESS contracted availability (guarantee tiers of 95-98 %; mature LFP sites target >= 97 %)"}, {"key": "degradation.pv_annual", "value": 0.5, "unit": "% per year", "status": "unverified", "source": "Jordan, D.C., Kurtz, S.R. (2013), 'Photovoltaic Degradation Rates - An Analytical Review', Prog. Photovolt. 21(1):12-29: median 0.5 %/yr"}, {"key": "degradation.pv_first_year", "value": 2.0, "unit": "%", "status": "unverified", "source": "Kersten et al., field tests in Cyprus and Germany: standard PERC initial light-induced degradation ~2 % (as summarised in search results)"}, {"key": "storage.round_trip_efficiency_lfp", "value": 0.85, "unit": "fraction, AC-AC", "status": "proxy", "source": "NREL Annual Technology Baseline 2025, ATBe.parquet v1.0.0, 'Round-Trip Efficiency', Utility-Scale Battery Storage, all scenarios (Cole, Ramasamy & Turan 2025)"}, {"key": "storage.hvac_load", "value": 2.6, "unit": "kW per MWh", "status": "unverified", "source": "Energy Central post 'BESS 5 MWh Aux consumption': 12-14 kW per 5 MWh container at 45-50 C ambient (value is the midpoint, 13 kW / 5 MWh)"}, {"key": "ro.specific_energy_seawater", "value": 5.34, "unit": "kWh/m3", "status": "sourced", "source": "Derived from MEW data in the dataset, 2021: electricity used by the three seawater RO plants (MEW Electrical Energy yearbook 2021, desalination use: Shuwaikh RO 124,868, Doha West RO 296,050, Az-Zour South RO 87,252 MWh) over their net production (MEW Water yearbook 2021: 21.97, 54.45, 18.69 million m3)"}, {"key": "wacc.kuwait_ipp", "value": 0.053, "unit": "fraction per year", "status": "unverified", "source": "IRENA (2023), The cost of financing for renewable power, Data Appendix: solar PV cost of capital, Kuwait 5.30 % (from Renewable Power Generation Costs in 2021)"}, {"key": "fx.kwd_per_usd", "value": 0.30667, "unit": "KWD per USD", "status": "unverified", "source": "Central Bank of Kuwait, Exchange Rate Policy: average exchange rate of the dinar against the US dollar, 2024: 306.67 fils"}, {"key": "finance.inflation", "value": 0.02, "unit": "fraction per year", "status": "proxy", "source": "US Federal Reserve FOMC, Statement on Longer-Run Goals and Monetary Policy Strategy: inflation objective of 2 percent"}, {"key": "tariff.mew_industrial_fils_per_kwh", "value": 5, "unit": "fils per kWh", "status": "sourced", "source": "MEW Statistical Year Book: Electrical Energy 2023, chapter 4, 'Tariff Of Electricity In All Sectors Of Consumption' (PDF p104): Investmental & Commercial 5, Industrial & Agriculture 5"}, {"key": "capex.pv_atb2025_usd_per_kw", "value": 1525.75, "unit": "USD per kW", "status": "proxy", "source": "NREL ATB 2025, ATBe.parquet v1.0.0, UtilityPV, CAPEX, Moderate, 2024"}, {"key": "capex.pv_irena2024_global_usd_per_kw", "value": 691.0, "unit": "USD per kW", "status": "unverified", "source": "IRENA, Renewable Power Generation Costs in 2024 (July 2025): global weighted-average utility PV total installed cost 691 USD/kW"}, {"key": "opex.pv_atb2025_usd_per_kw_year", "value": 24.66, "unit": "USD per kW-year", "status": "proxy", "source": "NREL ATB 2025, ATBe.parquet v1.0.0, UtilityPV, Fixed O&M, Moderate, 2024"}, {"key": "capex.battery_atb2025_usd_per_kwh", "value": 324.3, "unit": "USD per kWh", "status": "proxy", "source": "NREL ATB 2025, ATBe.parquet v1.0.0, Utility-Scale Battery Storage 4 h, OCC 1,297.38 USD/kW, Moderate, 2024, divided by 4 h"}, {"key": "capex.battery_gcc_ember2025_usd_per_kwh", "value": 125.0, "unit": "USD per kWh", "status": "unverified", "source": "Ember (Dec 2025), 'How cheap is battery storage?': all-in about 125 USD/kWh for >= 4 h projects; two Saudi auctions about 120 USD/kWh"}, {"key": "opex.battery_atb2025_usd_per_kw_year", "value": 51.9, "unit": "USD per kW-year", "status": "proxy", "source": "NREL ATB 2025, ATBe.parquet v1.0.0, Utility-Scale Battery Storage 4 h, Fixed O&M, Moderate, 2024"}, {"key": "demand.base_shape_nonsummer", "value": "inputs/demand/kuwait-gross-load-reconstructed.json#fit.params (c1, s1, c2, s2)", "unit": "two-harmonic diurnal shape, fraction of the monthly scale", "status": "proxy", "source": "the non-cooling component of the demand model, fitted to May-July daily data only (docs/decisions.md D2, D3)"}], "config_example": "# EXAMPLE, not a real design. A single-axis tracker plant at the scale of the Shagaya\n# Phase III Zone 1 tender (1,100 MW AC). Every design number below (string layout,\n# GCR, inverter count, export limit) is the example author's choice; modules and\n# inverters are real products from the CEC list (2019 vintage, so module power is low\n# by today's standards); everything else refers to the assumptions file.\nschema: kuwait-plant/0.1\nid: shagaya-scale-pv-tracker\nname: \"Example: 1.1 GW single-axis PV at Shagaya\"\nstatus: example\ndescription: >-\n  PV only. 1,429 MWp DC on 1,099 MW of central inverters (DC/AC 1.30), one module in\n  portrait on north-south trackers, exporting up to the inverter rating.\nsources:\n  - title: \"Shagaya site coordinates: Al Shagaya Solar Energy Park in PyPSA-Earth's powerplants.csv (powerplantmatching / Global Energy Monitor, CC BY 4.0)\"\n  - title: \"Zone 1 scale (1,100 MW): KAPP Shagaya Phase III tender, as reported (not verified from the build environment)\"\nsite:\n  location: {lat: 29.2055, lon: 47.0524}\n  grid_connection: {point: example-400kv, voltage_kv: 400, export_limit_mw: 1100}\npv:\n  arrays:\n    - id: a1\n      dc_capacity_mwp: 1428.98\n      module: {ref: \"library:jinko-jkm315pp-72\"}\n      mounting: {type: single_axis, axis_azimuth_deg: 180, max_angle_deg: 55, backtracking: true,\n                 stow: {wind_speed_m_s: 18, angle_deg: 0}}\n      layout: {gcr: 0.33, module_height_m: 1.5, collector_width_m: 1.924, modules_per_string: 22, strings: 205904}\ninverters:\n  topology: central\n  dc_ac_ratio: 1.30\n  transformer_losses_pct: 1.0\n  ac_collection_losses_pct: 1.0\n  units:\n    - {array: a1, ref: \"library:sma-sc-2500-ev\", count: 467}\ncontrols:\n  strategy: export_limit\nom:\n  cleaning:\n    method: robotic_dry\n    schedule: {type: interval, interval_days: 14}\neconomics:\n  base_year: 2026\n  life_years: 25\n  capex:\n    pv_total_usd_per_kwac: assumption:capex.pv_atb2025_usd_per_kw\n  opex:\n    pv_fixed_usd_per_kw_year: assumption:opex.pv_atb2025_usd_per_kw_year\n  finance: {structure: ppa, wacc_real: assumption:wacc.kuwait_ipp}\n  revenue: {}\nevaluation:\n  years: [2019, 2020, 2021, 2022, 2023]\n  system_context: kuwait-2023\n"}